# D3-TH-003: Two alcohols can have similar boiling behaviour but very different freezing behaviour
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 tert_butanol 5g @ 15C
add v2 isopropanol 5g @ 15C
measure v1 melting_point
measure v2 melting_point
measure v1 boiling_point
measure v2 boiling_point
look v1
look v2
heat v1 0.4kJ
heat v2 0.4kJ
look v1
look v2
inspect
